From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] unit: test the SMS status report signal

unit/test-smshistory.c runs plugins/smshistory.c on a private bus,
with the modem and its SMS atom faked: a delivered and a failed report
each give one StatusReport with the message's path and Delivered, the
submit states give none, a modem without an SMS atom gives none, and
the interface is listed on the modem while the driver is probed. Run
under dbus-run-session; the test reports itself skipped without a bus.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [tests the Sailfish OS SmsHistory plugin]
---
 Makefile.am            |  10 ++
 unit/test-smshistory.c | 344 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 354 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 unit/test-smshistory.c

diff --git a/Makefile.am b/Makefile.am
index 57bfed3..d0add69 100644
--- a/Makefile.am
+++ b/Makefile.am
@@ -1012,6 +1012,16 @@ unit_test_sim_euicc_LDADD = gdbus/libgdbus-internal.la @GLIB_LIBS@ \
 				@DBUS_LIBS@ $(ell_ldadd) -ldl
 unit_objects += $(unit_test_sim_euicc_OBJECTS)
 
+unit_tests += unit/test-smshistory
+
+unit_test_smshistory_SOURCES = unit/test-smshistory.c unit/test-dbus.c \
+				unit/test-dbus.h plugins/smshistory.c \
+				src/dbus.c src/common.c src/util.c
+unit_test_smshistory_CFLAGS = $(AM_CFLAGS) -DOFONO_PLUGIN_BUILTIN
+unit_test_smshistory_LDADD = gdbus/libgdbus-internal.la @GLIB_LIBS@ \
+				@DBUS_LIBS@ $(ell_ldadd)
+unit_objects += $(unit_test_smshistory_OBJECTS)
+
 unit_tests += unit/test-dbus-queue-atoms
 
 unit_test_dbus_queue_atoms_SOURCES = unit/test-dbus-queue-atoms.c \
diff --git a/unit/test-smshistory.c b/unit/test-smshistory.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9be8a95
--- /dev/null
+++ b/unit/test-smshistory.c
@@ -0,0 +1,344 @@
